#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:5
#: 49e33b4e08ba41ba8bed0c1e400542d2
msgid "GPS - How it Works"
msgstr "GPS - 工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:7
#: 5c3872c1f2d849119e9391e69c923ade
msgid "GPS system is a Global Navigation Satellite System (GNSS)."
msgstr "GPS 系统是一种全球导航卫星系统（GNSS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:12
#: 4dbe7c072524415d843fd0cba8b02d7a
msgid ""
"Most civil GPS receivers are using pseudorange data (C/A code) available on "
"GPS L1 channel (1575.42 MHz) and optionally they can receive SBAS DGPS "
"corrections giving meter precision."
msgstr ""
"大多数民用 GPS 接收机使用 GPS L1 频道（1575.42 MHz）上的伪距数据（C/A 码），也可选择接收 SBAS DGPS "
"校正，从而实现米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:19
#: 095740c09786470cafcd0fb61c20c908
msgid ""
"Advanced and expensive civil GPS receivers can use the previous method plus "
"carrier phase smoothing, carrier phase corrections (RTK) as well as L2 "
"channel P(Y) code semi-codeless tracking (1227.60 MHz) for realtime local "
"ionospheric corrections giving centimeter or even millimeter precision."
msgstr ""
"高级昂贵的民用 GPS 接收机可在上述方法基础上，增加载波相位平滑、载波相位校正（RTK）以及 L2 频道 P(Y) 码半无码跟踪（1227.60 "
"MHz）以实现实时本地电离层校正，从而达到厘米甚至毫米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:28
#: c3ff4a6607f04e64934146f6d9725390
msgid ""
"Some even more advanced GNSS receivers can combine DGPS and RTK corrections "
"and can receive other GNSS satellite constellations (GLONASS and GALILEO) "
"and other channels (L2C, L5...) at the same time to enhance precision and "
"fix reliability."
msgstr ""
"一些更先进的 GNSS 接收机可同时结合 DGPS 和 RTK 校正，并同时接收其他 GNSS 卫星星座（GLONASS 和 "
"GALILEO）及其他频段（L2C、L5 等），以提升精度和定位可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:33
#: 40e0dcdf2c634a2aa6ac8b6c0a689469
msgid ""
"Military GPS receivers are able to decode the P(Y) code available on L1 and "
"L2 channels giving ten times more precision in realtime compared to a "
"pseudorange basic solution."
msgstr "军用 GPS 接收机能够解码 L1 和 L2 频道上的 P(Y) 码，与伪距基础方案相比，实时精度可提升十倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:38
#: c7c6dfd987fb4b16b021f0a884502de4
msgid "GPS multipathing"
msgstr "GPS 多径效应"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:40
#: 3e365ef368474134b76d09bb41b0f9b8
msgid ""
"Multipathing is causing GPS position errors that are difficult to detect and"
" compensate for. Multiple GNSS receivers are better suited to filter out "
"multipathing thanks to a higher number of visible satellites at the same "
"time."
msgstr "多径效应会导致难以检测和补偿的 GPS 定位误差。多 GNSS 接收机由于同时可见卫星数量更多，更适合过滤多径效应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:58
#: caceaa7d24e54e47a1a60c59305275d4
msgid "GPS disturbed signal propagation"
msgstr "GPS 信号传播干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:60
#: 5d18d9e34ca04e078078fdfaf1747d2f
msgid ""
"Ionospheric perturbations and magnetic storms (solar activity) can cause "
"signal delays. This can be partially compensated using SBAS and L1 / L2 "
"decoding."
msgstr "电离层扰动和磁暴（太阳活动）可导致信号延迟。可通过 SBAS 和 L1/L2 解码进行部分补偿。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:70
#: b2b7a02ee38d4f5a9921173547bee423
msgid ""
"Decoding L1 and L2 channels at the same time do allow realtime ionospheric "
"corrections through a differential technique. Unlike SBAS broadcasted "
"ionospheric corrections, this method gives a better match to local "
"ionospheric conditions."
msgstr "同时解码 L1 和 L2 频道可通过差分技术实现实时电离层校正。与 SBAS 广播的电离层校正相比，该方法能更好地匹配本地电离层条件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:78
#: faa5af7a9f0a48f3a493e54deaec7287
msgid ""
"New channels (L2C, L5) for civil use will enhance signal acquisition and "
"position precision as soon as new satellites constellations will be complete"
" ( 2015 - 2020 )."
msgstr "面向民用的新频道（L2C、L5）将在新卫星星座完整建成后（2015—2020 年）增强信号捕获能力和定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:83
#: 97baeb4f8a0f426bb1e2dbe477d98a9c
msgid "GPS performance data for different scenarios"
msgstr "不同场景下的 GPS 性能数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:85
#: cab0b3b43da84ed6a3089589a9dfd635
msgid "Those values can be thought as a basis to understand GPS limitations."
msgstr "这些数值可作为了解 GPS 局限性的基础参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:87
#: c6e0c784695b43a9aaf3b3029fc5d989
msgid ""
"As a general rule only clear sky view is safe enough for Auto missions !"
msgstr "一般而言，只有在空旷天空视野下才能安全执行 Auto 任务！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:89
#: 616f4ec9f7444eb09040a5f10efd6e33
msgid "GPS 3D precision :"
msgstr "GPS 三维精度："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:91
#: 6558117daa1a49ff85f12b70235b5f48
msgid "Free Horizon (clear sky view): 2.5 m"
msgstr "空旷视野（晴空）：2.5 m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:92
#: 14d1063df4d84b2e819cfb1640caab78
msgid "Extreme Multipath (Backyards or between buildings flights): 26 m"
msgstr "极端多径（院子内或楼宇间飞行）：26 m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:93
#: 69565191d11844afb36353ed231466db
msgid "Indoor: 55 m"
msgstr "室内：55 m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:95
#: 709bcc6d103148be808dbecf32a9b522
msgid "GPS Availability :"
msgstr "GPS 可用性："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:97
#: 79089e61e755475fb573ab44ceea95aa
msgid "Free Horizon (clear sky view) : 99%"
msgstr "空旷视野（晴空）：99%"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:98
#: e9f18232941e4e65b9642c9f500875f3
msgid "Extreme Multipath (Backyards or between buildings flights) : 83 %"
msgstr "极端多径（院子内或楼宇间飞行）：83%"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:99
#: a7f681d5b0984693b2909d4d335b527e
msgid "Indoor : 14 %"
msgstr "室内：14%"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:102
#: 9cd0e823ee5143a28d715524d3edea6e
msgid "DGPS corrections"
msgstr "DGPS 校正"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:104
#: 00582d54ebad456d914fc236bda42e10
msgid ""
"DGPS corrections are using pseudorange data only. SBAS is a form of DGPS "
"correction freely available from one or more geostationary satellites."
msgstr "DGPS 校正仅使用伪距数据。SBAS 是一种可从一个或多个地球静止卫星免费获取的 DGPS 校正形式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:107
#: d226ae9729364cc0b47ae049b7be972a
msgid ""
"Each region of the world has a localized SBAS system : WAAS for America, "
"EGNOS for Europe, MSAS for Japan."
msgstr "全球各地区均有本地化 SBAS 系统：北美为 WAAS，欧洲为 EGNOS，日本为 MSAS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:110
#: 6771d5d5e98c4810b0eb8f2400e43dc2
msgid ""
"DGPS corrections give meter precision (free services) or decimeter precision"
" (paying services)"
msgstr "DGPS 校正可提供米级精度（免费服务）或分米级精度（付费服务）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:117
#: aaa79415f1884bc2a4f689cad2a47dcf
msgid "RTK corrections"
msgstr "RTK 校正"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:119
#: 700de405f9504d379747432d8e6da7c0
msgid ""
"RTK corrections are using carrier phase informations and needs costly "
"advanced GPS as well as a RTK base station or a Network of RTK base stations"
" broadcasting corrections over a modem or Internet through the RTCM "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"RTK 校正使用载波相位信息，需要昂贵的高级 GPS 以及 RTK 基站或通过调制解调器/互联网使用 RTCM 协议广播校正信号的 RTK 基站网络。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-how-it-works.rst:127
#: 58136ebcf73f4e1181268c873d953245
msgid ""
"RTK is easier to use with slow motion or static applications (like surveying"
" or farming) and give centimeter or millimeter precision."
msgstr "RTK 更适用于低速运动或静态应用（如测量或农业），可提供厘米甚至毫米级精度。"
